# GD-2 (round 19): L §4.2 "the month-days that are holidays every year (values of type `monthday`, §3.1 ...)";
# §3.1: 02-29 is no month-day (LOAD-PARSE).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
index yrs = year 2026..2027
input file_by: monthday
input other: monthday
input len: calendar

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  file_by = 04-30
  other = 04-30
  len = calendar(weekends [sat, sun], yearly [02-29])
ask q: file_by
=== expect
refused: LOAD-PARSE cannot parse: 02-29 is not a month-day every year has (m.tally:20)
